## Why this exists

The factory demonstrates how repository creation can be treated as infrastructure: standardized configuration, repeatable provisioning, and consistent developer-facing documentation.

## Workflow

```text
Terraform configuration
        ↓
GitHub Provider
        ↓
Repository creation
        ↓
Repository configuration
        ↓
Templated landing page
        ↓
GitHub Pages
```

